      "updated": 1755400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "auction asks ml to score a bid.\nml asks auction for the numbers it is\nallowed to quote. So they call each other.\n\nSafe because no health check crosses\nthe boundary — neither waits on the\nother to start.",
